{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore the origins of the mysterious Banban\u2019s Kindergarten. Survive the dark past of the establishment. Try to make some friends. Uncover the truth behind the place, and who you are\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/door.gif?t=1740263089\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the dark past of the kindergarten...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into the past of the kindergarten and explore the origins of the establishment. Only you can connect the dots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/truffletoot.gif?t=1740263089\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Opportunity to make friends\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your new home! Get out of your cell and meet your fellow neighbors. <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>Everything</i></span> Everyone here is loving and wants to be your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/top.gif?t=1740263089\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/look.gif?t=1740263089\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True Banbanner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3300410/2289f871376d69b21ce13b697e195adac09621d3.jpg"},{"name":"Popular Guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3300410/42d230fad869513857df985376a9bd70dfdb419b.jpg"},{"name":"Peeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3300410/8e9acbff3741b3b1b8406c8d611127169ef81f3d.jpg"},{"name":"Close To Kaboom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st